  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EARTH &#xbf; Enhanced Agroforestry for Resilient Timorese Households</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;goal&lt;/strong&gt; of the action is to increase food and income security and ensure sustainable and equitable benefits for Timorese women and men, including youth and other vulnerable groups, through a thriving climate-resilient agroforestry sector This impact will be achieved through four interrelated objectives such as:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective 1&lt;/strong&gt; ensures robust community and stakeholder engagement and ownership in agroforestry and carbon farming initiatives through comprehensive participatory planning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective 2&lt;/strong&gt; contributes to seeing ecosystem services restored and agricultural productivity enhanced through inclusive climate-resilient agroforestry practices&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective 3&lt;/strong&gt; will see gender equality and women&#xbf;s empowerment advanced through agroforestry development&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective 4&lt;/strong&gt; will see farmers&apos; incomes increased from agroforestry products&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Expected Outputs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt; of this Action that contribute to the above overall and specific objective are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1.1&lt;/strong&gt;: Complete the agroforestry mapping and contextual analyses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1.2: &lt;/strong&gt;Support the communities and stakeholders in participatory land use planning (PLUP).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1.3: &lt;/strong&gt;Communities experience equitable benefits from participation in carbon farming.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2.1:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish tree nurseries and made functioning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2.2: &lt;/strong&gt;Farmers equipped with knowledge and skills for climate-resilient agroforestry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2.3: &lt;/strong&gt;Agroforestry knowledge and capacity of agroforestry system stakeholders enhanced.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 3.1: &lt;/strong&gt;Gender equality, disability, and social inclusion (GEDSI) best practices promoted amongst agroforestry stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 3.2: &lt;/strong&gt;Financial capabilities improved to support agroforestry income generation with a focus on women.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 3.3: &lt;/strong&gt;Women have entrepreneurial skills and business plans to support agroforestry businesses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 4.1: &lt;/strong&gt;Agroforestry business model piloted in partnership with private sector partner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 4.2: &lt;/strong&gt;Farmers have improved access to financial services and investments in agroforestry production and processing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 4.3: &lt;/strong&gt; Agroforestry farmers have improved negotiation power and market access.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
